factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the unidentified persons enter at night and drink, break bottles, and make the place unhygienic, but the reel_script says the lake area has 'இரவில் மதுக்கூடமாக மாறி வருவதாக' — the article says the area is turned into an open bar, not specifically that the drinking is by night entrants; this is a minor mismatch, so the claim that the spot itself 'turned into a bar at night' is slightly distorted.
  The reel_script states that the lake was beautified 'ரூ பல லட்சம்' — the article says 'ரூ.பல லட்சம் மதிப்பில்', which matches, but the article also says social activists and NGOs plant saplings to beautify the bank; the reel_script says 'சமூக ஆர்வலர்களும் தொண்டு நிறுவனங்களும் மரக்கன்றுகளை நட்டு' which is accurate, so no issue there.
  The slides_spec 'இரவு நேர' slide title is ungrammatical/incomplete Tamil with no clear meaning as a slide heading.
  The slides_spec line 'குளக்கரை ரூ.பல லட்சம் மதிப்பில் அழகுபடுத்தப்பட்டது' is placed under the night-time slide with the demand, mixing the beautification fact with the complaint in one slide group, which is a mixed-fact issue.
  The reel_script omits the 'நகராட்சிக்குள்பட்ட' (under Vellakoil municipality) detail, which is not a critical omission but the article's key cause/actor details (night entrants) are present, so the main missing element is nothing critical; however the caption line 'Vellakoil KPC Nagar lake bank drinking spot' is a non-footer English line that is not in the article, and the phrase 'மதுக்கூடமாக மாறியதால் நடவடிக்கை கோரிக்கை' in the headline is an accurate paraphrase.
